SF0067 Long-term homeowner tax exemption-revisions.
Sponsored By: Joint Revenue Interim Committee
AN ACT relating to taxation; amending qualifications for the tax exemption for
long-term homeowners; repealing the sunset date for the exemption; specifying
applicability; and providing for an effective date.
